WEBVTT

01:41.789 --> 01:49.030
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.289 --> 01:51.920
[Episode 6]

02:19.400 --> 02:21.400
You really need to change this habit

02:21.840 --> 02:24.170
of walking away while someone is talking.

02:27.310 --> 02:28.190
But it's good

02:29.630 --> 02:31.090
that you knew to come home.

02:32.280 --> 02:34.280
If one day you really run away,

02:34.960 --> 02:36.120
what should I do?

02:37.430 --> 02:38.760
Wouldn't that be great?

02:39.030 --> 02:41.430
You wouldn't have to see me
and get annoyed.

02:44.710 --> 02:45.500
Just now,

02:45.960 --> 02:46.840
on my way back,

02:47.280 --> 02:49.610
I actually passed by my old normal school.

02:50.400 --> 02:52.400
When I graduated
as a kindergarten teacher,

02:52.400 --> 02:53.800
being assigned to the Children's Palace

02:53.800 --> 02:55.190
was quite an honor.

02:57.400 --> 02:59.030
But I wasn't a teacher.

02:59.470 --> 03:00.910
I worked in logistics.

03:03.150 --> 03:04.870
Back then, the people in our unit

03:04.870 --> 03:06.150
mostly got married and had kids

03:06.150 --> 03:07.560
in their twenties.

03:08.190 --> 03:10.390
So all of you kids
are about the same age.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.280
When kids got together,

03:14.590 --> 03:16.190
it was all about comparing.

03:16.970 --> 03:18.250
I was young then

03:20.130 --> 03:21.340
and quite vain.

03:23.460 --> 03:24.620
I already felt

03:24.620 --> 03:26.410
inferior to the teachers,

03:27.740 --> 03:29.940
and I was terrified you'd be outshined.

03:31.180 --> 03:32.440
Thinking about it now,

03:35.250 --> 03:37.250
I projected all my unfulfilled ambitions

03:37.250 --> 03:38.650
onto you.

03:45.360 --> 03:46.020
Tingting.

03:49.860 --> 03:51.590
You said several times earlier

03:52.930 --> 03:54.470
that you embarrassed me.

03:56.160 --> 03:58.190
You embarrassed me.

04:01.000 --> 04:02.700
I suddenly realized

04:04.310 --> 04:05.120
that I seem to

04:06.120 --> 04:09.080
have never given you
any positive affirmation.

04:10.910 --> 04:11.370
But

04:12.310 --> 04:14.150
during the competition just now,

04:14.150 --> 04:16.310
I clearly felt so proud.

04:17.040 --> 04:18.769
My daughter got into

04:19.160 --> 04:21.920
the experimental class
of the best high school.

04:22.560 --> 04:25.750
My daughter won second place
in the provincial competition.

04:25.750 --> 04:27.830
My daughter has accomplished
so many things

04:27.830 --> 04:30.270
that I could never possibly do.

04:31.430 --> 04:32.110
But why...

04:35.390 --> 04:37.870
why did I never tell her?

04:40.000 --> 04:43.120
But I really did perform poorly today.

04:44.620 --> 04:48.240
I didn't answer a single one
of my individual questions correctly.

04:48.240 --> 04:50.830
I really envy Lin Zhixia.

04:52.360 --> 04:54.750
She is the perfect child in adults' eyes.

04:54.870 --> 04:57.330
Her parents must be very proud of her,

04:57.330 --> 04:59.330
having such an excellent daughter.

04:59.500 --> 05:00.620
Unlike me,

05:00.770 --> 05:02.860
who only disappoints you every time.

05:05.130 --> 05:05.930
Tingting.

05:10.220 --> 05:11.980
I am also very proud.

05:14.190 --> 05:18.060
I have always been proud of you.

05:19.100 --> 05:20.060
Really?

05:22.860 --> 05:23.320
Really.

05:26.060 --> 05:26.980
You know what?

05:27.570 --> 05:29.450
In the competition just now,

05:30.220 --> 05:31.370
oh my goodness,

05:31.660 --> 05:34.659
you were standing
with so many impressive people.

05:35.220 --> 05:36.659
I suddenly felt

05:38.420 --> 05:40.570
that my daughter has grown up.

05:42.060 --> 05:44.810
But I'm always stuck in the past,

05:44.810 --> 05:47.420
when you were following me around

05:47.420 --> 05:48.510
calling "Mom."

05:49.240 --> 05:50.010
But

05:50.500 --> 05:52.270
I don't know since when

05:54.690 --> 05:57.090
I've struggled to understand what you say.

05:58.620 --> 06:00.820
I also don't know what you like anymore.

06:02.770 --> 06:05.010
But the more I try to know your thoughts,

06:05.930 --> 06:07.620
the further you want to hide.

06:11.620 --> 06:12.330
Tingting.

06:16.050 --> 06:17.810
I want to say sorry to you.

06:21.570 --> 06:23.930
I know my temper can be awful sometimes.

06:25.300 --> 06:27.360
And what I say isn't pleasant to hear.

06:28.300 --> 06:28.750
But...

06:30.060 --> 06:31.540
I was just worried.

06:32.980 --> 06:34.540
You came home,

06:34.860 --> 06:36.450
shut your door,

06:36.890 --> 06:39.090
and even wore headphones while eating.

06:39.220 --> 06:41.130
I really had no choice.

06:41.740 --> 06:43.980
I could only talk to you

06:43.980 --> 06:45.980
about your studies and your health.

06:48.180 --> 06:49.450
It's my fault.

06:52.370 --> 06:53.450
I have to learn

06:55.330 --> 06:56.060
to accept...

06:58.750 --> 06:59.570
to accept that my daughter

06:59.570 --> 07:01.500
is going to have her own world.

07:03.770 --> 07:06.620
Her world will get bigger and bigger,

07:08.660 --> 07:13.420
but I will get smaller and smaller in it.

07:17.620 --> 07:20.420
My baby will leave me sooner or later.

07:22.690 --> 07:24.220
I won't leave you.

07:27.130 --> 07:29.190
You won't leave even when you grow up?

07:29.810 --> 07:31.100
No.

07:32.100 --> 07:33.010
Okay.

07:34.500 --> 07:36.770
You will always be my little baby.

07:38.620 --> 07:41.150
Even when I'm old,
I'll still be your old baby.

07:59.690 --> 08:00.260
[Congratulations to!]

08:00.280 --> 08:01.640
[All contestants achieved
outstanding results in]

08:01.670 --> 08:02.920
[the Nanhai Rising Star Math Competition.
The list of winners is as follows:]

08:02.940 --> 08:04.610
[First Prize]
[Jiang Yubai, Jin Baihui, Duan Qiyan]

08:04.640 --> 08:06.660
[Second Prize]
[Lin Zhixia, Shen Fuxuan, Tang Tingting]

08:18.300 --> 08:19.100
Have you heard?

08:19.100 --> 08:21.930
Lin Zhixia's team came in second
in the math competition.

08:21.930 --> 08:23.790
So even geniuses fail sometimes.

08:24.100 --> 08:25.370
I watched that match.

08:25.420 --> 08:26.500
She was so arrogant,

08:26.500 --> 08:28.230
only caring about showing off.

08:50.580 --> 08:52.580
Ladies and gentlemen,

08:52.580 --> 08:54.100
good morning!

08:54.890 --> 08:57.460
Here comes
the provincial first-prize winner.

08:57.460 --> 08:58.460
Don't call me that.

08:58.460 --> 09:00.620
It makes us sound like strangers.

09:00.740 --> 09:01.820
If you ask me,

09:01.940 --> 09:03.980
Duan Qiyan didn't ride
his bike here today;

09:03.980 --> 09:05.340
he floated here.

09:05.980 --> 09:07.620
You're definitely right about that.

09:07.620 --> 09:10.280
My pockets haven't been this full
in a long time.

09:10.940 --> 09:12.530
Your dad's mood

09:12.860 --> 09:14.220
is really unstable.

09:14.410 --> 09:15.580
What do you know?

09:15.940 --> 09:18.970
This is called being clear
about rewards and punishments.

09:18.970 --> 09:21.700
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

09:19.050 --> 09:22.100
I'm treating everyone
to McDonald's after school today.

09:22.100 --> 09:23.530
Contestants

09:23.890 --> 09:25.100
and you guys

09:25.340 --> 09:26.410
all have to come.

09:26.410 --> 09:28.640
-You hear me? Let's celebrate.
-Okay.

09:28.820 --> 09:30.250
-I'm in.
-I'm in.

09:34.370 --> 09:36.170
Let's go together after school.

09:39.100 --> 09:39.630
Alright.

09:45.500 --> 09:47.620
Here comes the snack bucket.

09:51.050 --> 09:52.100
I ordered per person.

09:52.100 --> 09:53.170
You guys eat first.

09:53.170 --> 09:54.770
If it's not enough,

09:54.770 --> 09:55.620
give me the coupons,

09:55.620 --> 09:56.740
and I'll order more for everyone.

09:56.740 --> 09:57.740
For today's meal,

09:57.980 --> 09:58.980
I'm paying.

10:01.240 --> 10:02.170
That's awesome.

10:02.530 --> 10:04.220
You're really bleeding money today.

10:04.220 --> 10:05.890
This is fancier than the meal
you had for your birthday.

10:05.890 --> 10:06.890
Of course.

10:07.620 --> 10:10.170
This gathering for Class 1

10:10.170 --> 10:11.630
is of great significance.

10:11.860 --> 10:12.820
Why do I say that?

10:13.290 --> 10:14.340
Our school can be said to be

10:14.340 --> 10:16.980
the ever-victorious general
in this competition.

10:16.980 --> 10:19.530
The Provincial Experimental School
got first place in the preliminary.

10:19.530 --> 10:20.500
Did they really think

10:20.500 --> 10:21.580
they could shake

10:21.580 --> 10:23.170
our ruling position?

10:23.290 --> 10:24.340
How is that possible?

10:24.340 --> 10:25.770
Not to mention the championship,

10:25.770 --> 10:27.770
they didn't even get the runner-up.

10:28.050 --> 10:29.410
We are just too strong.

10:29.410 --> 10:31.890
Everyone, give us a round of applause!

10:32.100 --> 10:33.160
-Come on.
-Come on.

10:37.580 --> 10:38.500
But to be honest,

10:38.500 --> 10:40.620
the provincial first prize title
the three of you hold

10:40.620 --> 10:41.880
is still quite useful.

10:41.890 --> 10:43.250
Winning it in your freshman year

10:43.250 --> 10:44.370
means you can take
the independent recruitment exams

10:44.370 --> 10:45.620
of top universities

10:45.650 --> 10:48.580
in your sophomore and junior years.

10:48.580 --> 10:51.440
You might even get
a recommendation for admission.

10:51.500 --> 10:53.100
This has always been my goal.

10:53.340 --> 10:55.140
It seems that hard work pays off.

10:55.530 --> 10:56.980
I don't expect a provincial first prize.

10:56.980 --> 10:58.220
The points I accumulated
for the second prize

10:58.220 --> 11:00.550
are enough to keep my mom
happy for months.

11:01.410 --> 11:02.220
In that case,

11:02.530 --> 11:03.820
let's all make a toast.

11:04.130 --> 11:05.860
To celebrate our best experimental class,

11:05.860 --> 11:07.820
sweeping the top two spots
in the competition.

11:07.820 --> 11:08.500
What do you say?

11:08.500 --> 11:09.650
Come on, cheers!

11:10.250 --> 11:11.290
Don't forget,

11:11.500 --> 11:12.580
we should also congratulate

11:12.580 --> 11:13.860
our best player.

11:14.050 --> 11:15.050
Yes, right.

11:15.500 --> 11:18.130
Lin Zhixia is definitely the MVP,

11:18.130 --> 11:19.530
like a final boss.

11:19.860 --> 11:20.860
Come on, let's toast!

11:20.860 --> 11:22.150
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

11:22.170 --> 11:24.650
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

11:27.700 --> 11:28.700
This is delicious.

11:28.700 --> 11:29.530
Try this.

11:29.700 --> 11:30.500
Okay.

11:32.130 --> 11:33.190
Tissues. Tissues.

11:39.370 --> 11:40.390
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

11:40.390 --> 11:41.450
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

11:43.650 --> 11:44.850
-This one?
-Try this.

11:44.980 --> 11:45.860
Which one? This?

11:45.860 --> 11:48.050
-Yes.
-Do you want it? I'll eat it if you don't.

11:48.050 --> 11:48.980
I also want...

11:48.980 --> 11:49.580
What?

11:49.580 --> 11:50.170
A leg.

11:50.410 --> 11:51.340
If you don't eat it, I will.

11:51.340 --> 11:52.370
Seriously.

11:53.010 --> 11:54.470
You love eating that much?

11:55.010 --> 11:57.740
Duan Qiyan, you got lucky.

11:57.940 --> 11:59.250
Even though your grades
are better than ours,

11:59.250 --> 12:01.850
getting a provincial first prize
is a bit much.

12:02.010 --> 12:03.530
You do it if you can.

12:03.910 --> 12:05.050
Let me tell you,

12:05.170 --> 12:07.050
I was a top seed

12:07.100 --> 12:09.960
that the champion
and runner-up teams fought over.

12:10.300 --> 12:11.290
Are you okay?

12:12.500 --> 12:13.250
I'm fine.

12:14.100 --> 12:15.300
Am I invisible to you?

12:15.460 --> 12:16.700
That's treason.

12:17.650 --> 12:19.010
Screw you. I don't care.

12:19.010 --> 12:20.220
I'm the champion anyway.

12:20.220 --> 12:21.130
Okay, okay.

12:21.130 --> 12:23.250
Since Mr. Duan is paying today,

12:23.250 --> 12:25.150
let's give the champion
a round of applause.

12:25.150 --> 12:25.960
Come on.

12:26.770 --> 12:29.100
Mr. Duan is always right today.

12:32.170 --> 12:34.700
I have something to do
at home. I'll get going.

12:35.460 --> 12:37.370
Okay, be careful on the road.

12:37.460 --> 12:38.990
See you on Monday. Bye-bye.

12:40.010 --> 12:41.340
Let's play basketball later.

12:41.340 --> 12:42.290
Definitely.

12:42.290 --> 12:43.370
I'll spot you one hand this time

12:43.370 --> 12:44.700
and see if you can score.

13:34.890 --> 13:35.500
Alright.

13:40.220 --> 13:42.250
Your dad called this morning.

13:43.050 --> 13:46.650
He wanted to congratulate you

13:47.290 --> 13:48.940
for winning first place.

13:55.220 --> 13:57.410
I knew you wouldn't want to talk to him,

13:57.700 --> 13:59.430
so I told him you were sleeping.

14:03.940 --> 14:05.290
He must be bored.

14:05.980 --> 14:06.890
Doesn't he have anything to care about

14:06.890 --> 14:08.530
in his new family?

14:08.940 --> 14:10.980
His younger son can't even speak yet.

14:10.980 --> 14:13.780
Of course, he finds it easier
to interact with you.

14:13.890 --> 14:15.460
It's better not to talk.

14:15.890 --> 14:16.980
I am not sure

14:16.980 --> 14:18.440
what I might say to him now.

14:25.050 --> 14:25.860
I am

14:26.220 --> 14:28.130
not speaking for him.

14:29.010 --> 14:30.370
I just feel

14:30.500 --> 14:32.580
that this whole blood tie thing

14:33.130 --> 14:34.390
is quite fascinating.

14:35.620 --> 14:37.010
You know your dad.

14:37.290 --> 14:38.620
No one can handle him.

14:38.820 --> 14:40.250
But with you,

14:42.770 --> 14:44.580
he is really humble.

14:50.770 --> 14:52.460
He asked me to tell you

14:52.720 --> 14:53.650
that

14:53.860 --> 14:55.940
when you are in a good mood,

14:55.940 --> 14:57.460
give him a call,

14:57.890 --> 14:59.580
or a message is fine too.

15:01.530 --> 15:02.620
You have no idea.

15:02.860 --> 15:04.410
Being a parent for the first time,

15:04.410 --> 15:06.100
the bond he shares with his child

15:06.100 --> 15:07.340
can never be severed.

15:07.860 --> 15:08.700
So—

15:08.770 --> 15:10.230
Let's talk about it later.

15:20.010 --> 15:22.580
Why the long face?

15:23.620 --> 15:24.620
You got first place in the competition.

15:24.620 --> 15:26.050
Shouldn't you be happy?

16:45.170 --> 16:46.250
Hello.

16:47.890 --> 16:48.750
Hello, Auntie.

16:48.890 --> 16:50.220
I'm looking for Lin Zhixia.

16:50.220 --> 16:51.280
I'm her classmate.

16:52.460 --> 16:53.740
Zhixia is not home.

16:53.860 --> 16:54.890
She went out early in the morning

16:54.890 --> 16:56.340
and hasn't come back yet.

16:56.890 --> 16:57.980
What is your name?

16:57.980 --> 16:59.780
I'll tell her when she gets back.

17:02.620 --> 17:03.500
That's okay.

17:03.530 --> 17:05.180
It's nothing important.

17:05.660 --> 17:06.720
Thank you, Auntie.

17:18.420 --> 17:19.220
Lin Zhixia.

17:23.050 --> 17:24.650
Time for school, Lin Zhixia.

17:24.770 --> 17:25.900
You are still in bed?

17:28.500 --> 17:29.830
I took sick leave.

17:30.770 --> 17:32.630
Do I not know if you are sick or not?

17:33.940 --> 17:35.800
If you don't get up, I'm coming in.

17:38.850 --> 17:39.650
What's wrong?

17:40.810 --> 17:42.460
I have a fever, Zeqiu.

17:42.530 --> 17:44.570
Remember to ask for sick leave for me.

17:44.570 --> 17:45.530
A fever?

17:49.770 --> 17:51.300
You are not even as hot as me.

17:52.250 --> 17:54.180
You just don't want to go to school.

17:56.570 --> 17:58.090
Leave me alone.

17:58.700 --> 18:00.420
Is it really necessary, Lin Zhixia?

18:00.420 --> 18:03.550
It's just one competition
you didn't win first place in.

18:03.570 --> 18:05.250
What's the big deal?

18:06.090 --> 18:07.980
You just have never lost before.

18:07.980 --> 18:10.180
You can't even handle a little setback.

18:10.220 --> 18:11.010
In this world,

18:11.010 --> 18:13.140
you are not the only smart person.

18:13.140 --> 18:15.290
You will meet many people
smarter than you in the future,

18:15.290 --> 18:17.660
and you will experience
a lot of setbacks and failures.

18:17.660 --> 18:18.850
If you can't even handle this,

18:18.850 --> 18:19.900
what will you do later?

18:19.900 --> 18:21.290
If I had a mindset like yours,

18:21.290 --> 18:22.980
I would have broken down long ago.

18:22.980 --> 18:24.500
This is a lesson you must go through.

18:24.500 --> 18:25.900
Come on, get up.

18:26.700 --> 18:28.380
Leave me alone!

18:28.940 --> 18:31.220
I-I was just trying to reason with you.

18:32.810 --> 18:34.610
You don't understand anything.

18:35.420 --> 18:38.220
I... I didn't say anything harsh.

18:40.050 --> 18:41.450
I'm going to school then.

18:42.290 --> 18:43.380
I left the milk here.

18:43.380 --> 18:45.380
Remember to drink it when you get up.

19:00.140 --> 19:01.810
Okay, let's go to the second one.

19:01.220 --> 19:03.990
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

19:02.420 --> 19:04.500
People don't need to worry because...

19:04.500 --> 19:06.700
A, B, C, D, E.

19:07.610 --> 19:09.140
Who knows the right answer?

19:50.290 --> 19:51.220
Hello.

19:51.570 --> 19:51.970
Hello.

19:52.770 --> 19:54.460
Lin Zhixia, it's me.

19:55.700 --> 19:56.610
Shen Fuxuan?

19:58.250 --> 19:59.500
What's up?

20:00.700 --> 20:02.630
Why didn't you come to class today?

20:03.090 --> 20:03.900
Are you sick?

20:07.290 --> 20:08.690
I have a bit of a headache,

20:08.940 --> 20:09.670
but I'm fine.

20:10.850 --> 20:12.940
My dad bought
some headache medicine before.

20:12.940 --> 20:14.140
It works really well.

20:14.790 --> 20:16.520
Do you want me to bring you some?

20:17.090 --> 20:18.830
No need. I'm almost recovered.

20:20.740 --> 20:23.240
I'll let you know if I need it.

20:23.830 --> 20:24.160
Okay.

20:24.850 --> 20:25.910
Get some rest then.

20:27.610 --> 20:28.140
Bye-bye.

20:28.570 --> 20:29.100
Bye-bye.

21:00.640 --> 21:08.270
♪ Wandering light wind
drifts past your pupils ♪

21:09.420 --> 21:13.650
♪ One second of encounter,
heartstrings stirred ♪

21:14.270 --> 21:17.630
♪ The story feels altogether different ♪

21:19.180 --> 21:23.520
♪ The moment our eyes met,
my world came alive with color ♪

21:24.190 --> 21:28.470
♪ Could this be how love begins? ♪

21:29.000 --> 21:32.060
♪ These unspoken feelings
are so hard to figure out ♪

21:32.590 --> 21:37.900
♪ Hidden deep within your gaze ♪

21:38.130 --> 21:42.540
♪ Sometimes, I imagine
drifting beyond the skies with you ♪

21:39.460 --> 21:40.460
Did you fold this?

21:43.280 --> 21:47.300
♪ Shimmering light
dances over the flower in bloom ♪

21:48.180 --> 21:51.030
♪ After all we've been through,
our fates remain intertwined ♪

21:50.140 --> 21:51.740
If Mr. Kong finds out you skipped class,

21:51.740 --> 21:52.850
he will be furious.

21:53.460 --> 21:54.520
You should go back.

21:55.160 --> 21:55.620
No need.

21:56.140 --> 21:57.140
I asked for leave.

22:02.200 --> 22:04.060
You didn't come to school all day.

22:05.050 --> 22:06.610
I was quite worried.

22:09.010 --> 22:09.980
I'm fine.

22:11.010 --> 22:12.330
I'll adjust on my own.

22:19.940 --> 22:21.870
If you're unhappy about anything,

22:22.850 --> 22:24.050
you can tell me.

22:28.570 --> 22:30.630
I thought since we became opponents,

22:31.940 --> 22:33.940
we wouldn't chat like this anymore.

22:34.740 --> 22:36.470
Actually, these past few days,

22:37.330 --> 22:38.930
I've been quite conflicted.

22:40.740 --> 22:41.800
Speaking of which,

22:42.330 --> 22:43.850
since I met you,

22:43.940 --> 22:45.670
this is the first time I've won.

22:45.810 --> 22:47.010
Logically speaking,

22:47.420 --> 22:48.810
I should be very happy.

22:49.500 --> 22:52.500
After all, I achieved my goal
through my own hard work.

22:53.420 --> 22:54.700
But after that, when facing you,

22:54.700 --> 22:57.030
I became much more sensitive than before.

22:58.500 --> 22:59.330
After the competition that day,

22:59.330 --> 23:01.390
I noticed you were acting strangely.

23:01.940 --> 23:03.940
But I didn't know how to comfort you.

23:04.290 --> 23:06.620
I was afraid you'd think
I was showing off.

23:11.570 --> 23:13.380
These past few days,
I've been trying to figure out

23:13.380 --> 23:14.940
what is bothering me.

23:17.610 --> 23:20.410
Is it that a former good friend
became an opponent?

23:21.090 --> 23:23.250
Or was it because my poor decision

23:23.700 --> 23:25.630
led to the loss of the competition?

23:27.220 --> 23:28.480
It seems to be neither.

23:31.350 --> 23:32.210
Then what is it?

23:37.280 --> 23:39.700
It's that I've been trying
so hard to fit in,

23:42.080 --> 23:44.140
yet it's always so difficult to do so.

23:50.500 --> 23:53.940
From the very beginning,
no one wanted to team up with me.

23:55.140 --> 23:56.670
If it weren't for your help,

23:57.330 --> 24:00.860
I probably wouldn't have been able
to gather enough teammates.

24:00.940 --> 24:02.800
When Tang Tingting joined later,

24:03.250 --> 24:05.380
I really wanted to lead her to victory.

24:05.660 --> 24:06.860
I thought by doing so,

24:07.380 --> 24:08.420
the two of us could become

24:08.420 --> 24:09.980
closer friends.

24:11.980 --> 24:13.780
Moreover, the math competition

24:14.090 --> 24:15.330
is my forte.

24:17.330 --> 24:18.660
But I still messed it up.

24:20.810 --> 24:24.500
A competition actually
consists of many factors.

24:25.420 --> 24:27.680
Tang Tingting had her own takeaways too.

24:28.140 --> 24:30.500
So you don't need
to care too much about it.

24:34.330 --> 24:34.810
Yeah.

24:36.140 --> 24:37.470
Everyone had takeaways

24:38.570 --> 24:40.250
and achieved something.

24:43.250 --> 24:45.580
I only have a strong sense of frustration.

24:48.090 --> 24:49.570
I don't know why.

24:50.090 --> 24:51.810
I've been trying so hard

24:51.810 --> 24:52.980
to fit into the group

24:53.330 --> 24:54.930
and be friendly to everyone.

24:55.940 --> 24:57.740
Yet people just won't accept me.

24:58.380 --> 24:59.980
They just wait to see me fall,

25:00.610 --> 25:04.380
and then mock me,
saying a genius is nothing more than this.

25:05.770 --> 25:08.430
Even though I pretend
not to care on the outside,

25:09.380 --> 25:11.570
every targeted attack

25:12.850 --> 25:14.290
and every look of rejection—

25:14.290 --> 25:15.700
I can feel them all.

25:18.570 --> 25:19.900
Sometimes I think

25:22.140 --> 25:23.740
if I wasn't in this class,

25:25.500 --> 25:27.300
would it be better for everyone?

25:34.980 --> 25:36.810
So this is why you are upset.

25:47.980 --> 25:48.510
Let's go.

25:49.810 --> 25:50.350
Where to?

25:52.010 --> 25:53.610
You'll see when we get there.

25:53.810 --> 25:55.610
I want to prove something to you.

26:26.440 --> 26:28.010
♪ Warm fishbowl ♪

26:29.190 --> 26:30.550
♪ Glass sprouts forth ♪

26:31.200 --> 26:33.050
♪ Drowning at dusk ♪

26:33.990 --> 26:35.420
♪ You come to save me ♪

26:35.920 --> 26:37.850
♪ Such oddities ♪

26:38.710 --> 26:40.650
♪ Bizarre dreams ♪

26:41.000 --> 26:42.860
♪ You call them ♪

26:43.960 --> 26:45.450
♪ Frozen in frame ♪

26:46.160 --> 26:47.830
♪ You dwell within ♪

26:48.630 --> 26:50.590
♪ My daylight flight ♪

26:50.920 --> 26:52.850
♪ The bluest dreamcore ♪

26:53.640 --> 26:55.410
♪ Boundless, endless ♪

26:55.870 --> 26:57.450
♪ Can barely breathe ♪

26:58.300 --> 27:00.150
♪ Sinking to the seabed ♪

27:00.680 --> 27:02.840
♪ I don't know ♪

27:03.560 --> 27:06.140
♪ Why ♪

27:36.330 --> 27:37.530
Remember this place?

27:38.010 --> 27:40.210
The box we buried here when we were kids.

27:40.500 --> 27:43.030
Jiang Yubai, do you know
about time capsules?

27:43.460 --> 27:44.570
Time capsules?

27:45.740 --> 27:47.150
Let's write down our wishes.

27:47.150 --> 27:49.420
When we get to junior high,
we'll come back and open the capsules,

27:49.420 --> 27:50.140
okay?

27:55.010 --> 27:55.940
We were supposed

27:56.380 --> 27:58.500
to open the box in junior high,

27:59.140 --> 28:00.500
but you left suddenly.

28:02.010 --> 28:03.420
Let's dig it out now.

28:16.530 --> 28:18.740
Why are we digging it up today?

28:20.090 --> 28:21.290
Don't you understand

28:21.770 --> 28:24.290
what your presence means to the class?

28:26.610 --> 28:28.670
What does that have to do with the box?

28:29.530 --> 28:31.380
The answer is on that note.

28:40.980 --> 28:41.770
Found it.

29:21.610 --> 29:25.850
Be best friends
with Jiang Yubai forever.

29:28.940 --> 29:31.340
Become a genius
as excellent as Lin Zhixia.

29:39.500 --> 29:42.160
Actually, this has always been
my true thought,

29:42.980 --> 29:45.780
but I'm always misunderstood
by people around me.

29:45.900 --> 29:47.630
They think I see you as an enemy,

29:48.740 --> 29:50.200
and that I hate Lin Zhixia.

29:51.570 --> 29:54.630
You thought so too
during the competition, didn't you?

30:00.940 --> 30:03.810
But I just see you as my goal

30:05.570 --> 30:06.740
and as

30:07.460 --> 30:08.810
the person I want to be.

30:11.530 --> 30:12.790
In elementary school,

30:13.050 --> 30:14.770
no one really understood,

30:15.460 --> 30:16.860
but it's much better now.

30:18.050 --> 30:19.770
Because in the experimental class,

30:19.770 --> 30:21.250
everyone is a top student,

30:22.530 --> 30:24.050
and no one wants to lose.

30:25.810 --> 30:27.380
You must often feel

30:27.530 --> 30:29.010
the hostility around you.

30:30.010 --> 30:31.530
Some is obvious,

30:32.090 --> 30:33.330
and some is hidden.

30:34.810 --> 30:36.460
So you often get hurt

30:37.330 --> 30:40.060
and start to doubt
the meaning of your existence.

30:41.090 --> 30:42.140
I think,

30:42.740 --> 30:44.250
in the end, it's because

30:44.940 --> 30:46.460
most people in our class

30:47.810 --> 30:49.770
want to be as excellent as you.

30:51.740 --> 30:52.530
Really?

30:53.770 --> 30:54.240
Yeah.

30:55.660 --> 30:57.120
You are like a bellwether,

30:57.530 --> 30:59.790
setting the height of everyone's goals.

30:59.900 --> 31:01.500
With Lin Zhixia here,

31:02.290 --> 31:04.290
everyone in the experimental class

31:04.420 --> 31:05.820
becomes a better person.

31:09.530 --> 31:11.530
Then can I only be their goal,

31:12.900 --> 31:15.090
not their good friend?

31:21.850 --> 31:24.510
I also want to have
a wonderful high school life.

31:25.500 --> 31:27.630
I want to have a group of close friends.

31:28.570 --> 31:30.430
We can go to the library together,

31:31.010 --> 31:32.420
share snacks,

31:33.420 --> 31:36.250
do some crazy and romantic things,

31:38.140 --> 31:40.700
go to places no one has ever been,

31:40.740 --> 31:41.940
talk about our dreams,

31:41.940 --> 31:43.200
and study side by side.

31:45.740 --> 31:48.810
Actually, when we teamed up
for the competition,

31:49.330 --> 31:51.220
I had many precious experiences.

31:53.330 --> 31:55.330
I thought it was a good start

31:56.290 --> 31:58.660
and that I would slowly make good friends

31:59.940 --> 32:01.610
and slowly fit into the group.

32:07.610 --> 32:09.540
I didn't expect to mess it up again.

32:12.570 --> 32:13.900
You must believe

32:14.460 --> 32:15.860
that this is a good start.

32:17.130 --> 32:20.060
And never be afraid of
having conflicts with others.

32:20.460 --> 32:21.570
Whatever happens,

32:21.810 --> 32:22.740
good or bad,

32:23.420 --> 32:24.530
is an indispensable puzzle piece

32:24.530 --> 32:25.810
in your life story.

32:26.660 --> 32:27.460
I believe

32:28.140 --> 32:29.940
the high school life you long for

32:30.940 --> 32:32.470
will definitely come true.

32:46.810 --> 32:49.540
Don't you want to
be good friends with me forever?

32:50.220 --> 32:51.550
Aren't we good friends?

32:51.850 --> 32:54.180
I mean being good friends with me forever.

32:55.420 --> 32:56.050
I do.

33:06.050 --> 33:07.910
Someone's coming. Hide quickly.

33:08.700 --> 33:14.110
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

33:15.660 --> 33:21.380
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

33:22.640 --> 33:28.260
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

33:29.480 --> 33:35.430
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

33:37.710 --> 33:44.040
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

33:44.770 --> 33:50.290
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

33:49.330 --> 33:50.460
It's getting late.

33:50.740 --> 33:51.900
You should go home soon.

33:51.220 --> 33:54.030
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

33:54.650 --> 33:57.630
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

33:55.090 --> 33:56.420
I'll go back first then.

33:58.210 --> 34:00.350
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

33:59.180 --> 34:00.050
Tomorrow...

34:00.840 --> 34:04.520
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

34:00.900 --> 34:01.900
see you at school?

34:02.770 --> 34:03.770
See you at school.

34:05.230 --> 34:07.630
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

34:08.550 --> 34:11.280
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

34:09.420 --> 34:11.460
You should keep this iron box.

34:12.050 --> 34:14.480
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

34:15.239 --> 34:18.449
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

34:18.650 --> 34:19.460
Jiang Yubai.

34:19.469 --> 34:22.260
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

34:22.300 --> 34:22.980
Thank you.

34:23.010 --> 34:25.790
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

34:26.300 --> 34:32.170
♪ Hence I lose you, time and again ♪

34:29.980 --> 34:30.940
Go back quickly.

34:31.380 --> 34:31.909
Goodbye.

34:32.050 --> 34:32.580
Goodbye.

34:33.159 --> 34:35.690
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

34:36.440 --> 34:39.330
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

34:39.810 --> 34:42.050
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

34:42.489 --> 34:46.150
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

34:46.960 --> 34:49.409
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

34:50.320 --> 34:53.030
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

34:53.739 --> 34:56.330
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

34:56.920 --> 35:00.120
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪
